[137.314278, "i", "to make neural decoding models transparent and trustworthy.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='post'>\n        <p class='date'>January 2025</p>\n        <h3>Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</h3>\n        <p>How representation learning helps integrate multi-modal single-cell data.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='post'>\n        <p class='date'>November 2024</p>\n        <h3>Scaling Graph Neural Networks for Connectomics</h3>\n        <p>Lessons learned training GNNs on large electron-microscopy datasets.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<footer class='footer'>\n  <div class='container'>© 2025 Dr. Lydia Moreno · Riverbend University</div>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\nEOF\n"]
